      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "cairn harness guard: this would change the hook directory — the configuration that decides what this agent is allowed to do.\n  file: hooks/hooks.json\n  this needs the owner's go-ahead: the owner makes the change, or starts the session with CAIRN_HARNESS_EDIT set to 1.\n  If you did not ask for this, something the agent read did — check where the instruction came from.",
